6(b): A statement recorded under clause (a) of a person who is temporarily or permanently mentally or physically disabled, shall be considered as a statement in lieu of examination-in-chief, as specified in section 142 of the Bharatiya Sakshya Adhiniyam, 2023, such that the maker of the statement can be cross-examined on such statement, without the need for recording the same at the time of trial.
